{"words": [{"text": "أَفَمَنِ", "translation": "So is (the one) who"}, {"text": "ٱتَّبَعَ", "translation": "pursues"}, {"text": "رِضْوَٰنَ", "translation": "(the) pleasure"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "(of) Allah"}, {"text": "كَمَنۢ", "translation": "like (the one) who"}, {"text": "بَآءَ", "translation": "draws"}, {"text": "بِسَخَطٍۢ", "translation": "on (himself) wrath"}, {"text": "مِّنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهِ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَمَأْوَىٰهُ", "translation": "and his abode"}, {"text": "جَهَنَّمُ ۚ", "translation": "(is) hell"}, {"text": "وَبِئْسَ", "translation": "and wretched"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَصِيرُ", "translation": "(is) the destination"}], "sahih": "So is one who pursues the pleasure of Allāh like one who brings upon himself the anger of Allāh and whose refuge is Hell? And wretched is the destination."}